ed against a tutorial package conforming to the\n  defined packaging format (both tutorial kinds).\n- The gallery renders and launches correctly for a user with a single selected\n  project, with resources landing in that project.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): the Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can launch\n  a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook, or\n  importing the pipeline).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35991,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-825fc3402b7e8127","agent_id":"a8883c02dfbae495e","session_id":"8e8f3f7e-9881-4ba0-8b86-168f23b1e6dd","uuid":"e33d6bd5-7aae-4cac-a73c-c9d818b66a6a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:05:04.837Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019"}
