nventions\n51\t  (OdhDashboardConfig).\n52\t- Incidental gallery UI text and captions that fall out of this change are\n53\t  included here as scope; they are not separately authored content.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- A user can browse the tutorial gallery in the Dashboard and see the available\n58\t  tutorials with their metadata.\n59\t- Launching a notebook tutorial creates or opens a workbench in the user's\n60\t  project with the tutorial notebook loaded and the pinned image running.\n61\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial imports the pipeline into the project's Data\n62\t  Science Pipelines instance.\n63\t- End-to-end launch is verified against a tutorial package conforming to the\n64\t  defined packaging format (both tutorial kinds).\n65\t- The gallery renders and launches correctly for a user with a single selected\n66\t  project, with resources landing in that project.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-1 (P0): the Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can launch\n71\t  a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook, or\n72\t  importing the pipeline).\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e582ab3f6005988","agent_id":"a8756bfc8c6f3dfa6","session_id":"8e8f3f7e-9881-4ba0-8b86-168f23b1e6dd","uuid":"cd43e562-9e63-4d2b-ba4e-b71dc2217f6a","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:07:33.413Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a5cf68c44456306","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
